      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "听、听说您以前是银河座的成员，是真的吗！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来是问这个啊～。真拿你没办法……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070040",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 402,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
