      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊！？ 难道我问了什么不该问的事！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "别在意。现在想来已经是段不错的回忆了。/n而且我在银河座也只演过两部戏而已。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "居然在那个银河座演过两部！？/n太厉害了，我好崇拜您……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不，那只是因为银河座的规矩……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……算了，细节就别管了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070081",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真好啊。我也想去一次银河剧场！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过既然来了东京，天狼星也绝对不能错过！/n我最近很在意心菜，她实在太耀眼了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可Eden也很帅！剧团电姬又很可爱！/n如今说浅草地区是演剧界的中心也不为过——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你看起来很开心嘛？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊！？ 对不起，我一不小心就说个没完了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我懂。我偶尔也会去看银河座。/n电视和杂志给她们做专题的机会也越来越多了呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "新人演员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "对！就是这样！前阵子的专题您看了吗！？/nEden的初魅大人平时完全不接受电视采访，可那次居然——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "伦子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（演剧热潮越来越火了呢～。/n　大家现在肯定忙得团团转吧）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "SpineId": 50301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "503"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1460",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是那家伙的女儿，千寿历吧？/n百忙之中还劳烦你跑一趟。",
      "BgmFileName": "23",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哪里。能有幸拜会各位Dai Star，/n实乃不胜荣幸。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你的活跃我们都看在眼里。不愧是千寿家的千金。/n不过，门第这种东西对你来说恐怕只是多余的装饰吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她说得有点绕，不过是在夸千寿历你的实力。/n别放在心上哦。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我明白。那么，各位找我所为何事？/n若是愿意赐教，我自当欣然领受。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "只是我们这些银河座旧成员的一点任性要求。/n做不到的话，直说做不到就行。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如今演剧界这般繁荣，实在令人刮目相看。/n我们深爱的浅草有多么热闹，大家有目共睹。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是的。天狼星、Eden、剧团电姬。/n无一不是特色鲜明的优秀剧团。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以我们对你的期望只有一个。/n希望银河座能成为无数群星之中永不黯淡的一等星。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "简单来说，就是希望你们引领如今这股演剧热潮。/n以不辱银河座传统的活跃表现。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我相信银河座会回应这份期待。/n能做到吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……当然。/n各位所深爱的银河，将会比现在升得更高。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "下一场公演，是大家再熟悉不过的传统剧目。/n银河座的光辉，必将成为天上的印记。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊，要演那一部。那可真让人期待。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030207035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030207,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "原剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我很期待啊，千寿家的女儿。/n别让我们的银河，被夏日星之峰那种地方遮了光。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302070330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
